          "confidence": 0.8
        }
      ],
      "sketch": "Move methods notify, sent_count, and reset_sent, along with attributes _notifier and _sent, into a NotificationService class. OrderService should delegate notification tasks to this service. This separates the side-effect of sending notifications from the core order management logic."
    }
  ],
  "risk_notes": "Refactoring will increase the number of classes in the project and may increase DCC for OrderService if it needs to reference the new services. It requires updating all callers of OrderService methods that are moved to the new classes. The behavior must remain identical, so careful testing is required to ensure that delegation does not introduce bugs or performance overhead. The DAM metric for OrderService may change depending on how the new services are injected and managed."
